              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.9.6+2CO.9.7+2CO.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 9:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mureete ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi ebihikire omu mabiikiro gangye, enju yangye ebone kubamu eby'okurya, mubingyerese, haza mureebe ku ntaabaigurira madarisa g'omu iguru, nkabashukaho omugisha, mukabura n'ah'okuguta; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndyakabukira orikwenda kubamira, arekye kucwekyereza emyaka y'omu itaka ryangyu, n'emizaabibu yaanyu teribura kwana; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
